The Vertical Grip is a weapon attachment featured in Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege. It greatly increases the control a player has on a weapon's recoil as well as adding increased hip-fire accuracy. As such, it is extremely useful in allowing players to safely engage enemies more accurately from a distance.

The M762, BOSG.12.2, ALDA 5.56, M4, AR-15.50, SC3000K, UZK50GI have their unique variants of the vertical grip available. However, they are only visually different and posess the same properties. The G8A1 and the ALDA 5.56 have the vertical grip mounted on the side instead of the bottom.

